###
GET http://localhost:8080/products/7bb8c57e-e0a8-4451-a8fa-5a9d2584accc

### Including sub-resources
GET http://localhost:8080/products/7bb8c57e-e0a8-4451-a8fa-5a9d2584accc?include=categories,tags

### List products
GET http://localhost:8080/products

### List products: Filter by brand
GET http://localhost:8080/products?brand=Apple

### List products: Filter by price
GET http://localhost:8080/products?priceEq=10

###
GET http://localhost:8080/products?
    brand=Logitech,Samsung
    &price=lte:1000
    &rating=gte:3
    &product[tag]=wireless,stam
    &product[category]=Accessories
    &offset=0
    &limit=20

